join techcorp_interviewer center

techcorp_interviewer: Terakhir - Apa yang anda ketahui tentang Agile methodology?

[signal arg="timer_start"]

- Sprint-based development dengan iterative process
	set {interview_score} += 20
	set {interview_health} += 20
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	techcorp_interviewer: Perfect! Anda benar-benar understand modern development.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Metodologi kerja yang fleksibel
	set {interview_score} += 10
	set {interview_health} += 10
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	techcorp_interviewer: Correct tapi general. Need deeper understanding.
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]

- Cara kerja cepat tanpa dokumentasi
	set {interview_score} -= 8
	set {interview_health} -= 8
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	techcorp_interviewer: That's a misconception. Agile doesn't mean no documentation.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

- Tidak tahu, belum pernah dengar
	set {interview_score} -= 5
	set {interview_health} -= 5
	[signal arg="timer_end"]
	techcorp_interviewer: Industry standard knowledge yang basic. Disappointing.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

[wait time="1.0"]
[signal arg="update_ui"]

# Final interview conclusion
[wait time="1.0"]

techcorp_interviewer: Alright, technical assessment selesai.

if {interview_score} >= 30:
	techcorp_interviewer: Outstanding! Welcome to the TechCorp family. HR akan follow up.
elif {interview_score} >= 15:
	techcorp_interviewer: Good potential. Kami akan diskusi dengan team dulu.
elif {interview_score} >= 5:
	techcorp_interviewer: Masih perlu development, tapi keep learning.
else:
	techcorp_interviewer: Sorry, technical skills tidak memenuhi standar kami.

set {day2_completed} = true
set {day2_score} = {interview_score}

leave techcorp_interviewer
